    {
      "n": 18,
      "sourceEntry": 1181,
      "speaker": "DIRECTOR",
      "kind": "stage_direction_before",
      "text": "They wear raincoats and hats. They have their nightdresses under the coats. They are obviously drunk. GWENDOLYN more than MONICA because she’s not used to it. MONICA supports her. GWENDOYN bumps her head on the door frame.",
